        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-05T14:50:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There's a few edge cases where that'll help Ammo Drop.&nbsp; Apostate pull out a midgame Apocalypse and you don't have any ongoing destruction? Omnitron pull a Sedative Fleschettes or a Technological Singularity&nbsp;out? Draw ALL THE CARDS!&nbsp;</p><p>Incapped Ra: Horus of Two Horizons?&nbsp; Put a card from a Hero Trash on top of the Hero Deck?&nbsp; Can be helpful.</p><p>Incapped PW Tempest: Put a card from a Hero Trash into play?&nbsp; Seems nice to me.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:28:00.103Z",
